{"sections":[{"slug":"正线丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"正线丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">正线丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“正线丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>“<span lang=\"zh\">正性</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">与存在很多全局截面这件事有关</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而存在很多全局截面意味着一个代数簇可以映射到</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">甚至嵌入</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/射影空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复流形上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">正线丛</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率形式</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">乘以</span> $\\sqrt{-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">后是一个正定</span> $(1,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/小平嵌入定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">小平嵌入定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表明正线丛是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/丰沛线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">丰沛线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/小平消失定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">小平消失定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}